{"result":{"data":{"items":[{"_id":"694b331040e3a562f55b8154","title":"v0.21.0-beta (Happy Christmas)","content":"<div data-youtube-video=\"\"><iframe class=\"tiptap-youtube\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" autoplay=\"false\" disablekbcontrols=\"false\" enableiframeapi=\"false\" endtime=\"0\" ivloadpolicy=\"0\" loop=\"false\" modestbranding=\"true\" origin=\"\" playlist=\"\" rel=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/0bhsXykXxfg?modestbranding=1&amp;rel=1\" start=\"0\"></iframe></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">New mission system</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">New mission system, replacing the daily rewards and daily xp.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Missions are recurring missions that can be claimed daily, weekly.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">A daily cases is still claimable in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">There is also basic starting missions for new players.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">With this change the total weekly xp a player can goes from 1050 -&gt; 1700.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This change is needed to make players progress faster and join the level plateau more easily.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">New military rank system</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Added military rank system giving attack skill percent bonus</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The curve is logarithmic for new players to progress way faster than the old ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">I changed the % attack calculation, now percent are multiplied together instead of summed up (pill ratio <em>ammo ratio </em>military rank ratio).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Because these changes will probably increase damages of players, I lowered the loot chance per 1k dmg from 3% =&gt; 2.5%. And the pill bonus to 80% =&gt; 60%.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Translations</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"user\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/user/6840d2a8fc1ca92f404e231d\" contenttype=\"user\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\"https://app.warera.io/user/6840d2a8fc1ca92f404e231d\"></span> worked hard to add translation module to the game, you can now switch languages from the options (left menu).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Not the whole game is translated, more translation gonna come later.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">For now there is not a lot of languages, but it's a start.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">For now we don't need any help with translations, we will let you know if we do.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Tutorial</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">I added new steps to the tutorial: Claim mission reward, open &amp; send message in country chat</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">I reworked the wording and ofc its translated.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">New users inventory</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">I found that new users had very little inventory and its hard for them to achieve basic actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">So I added some items:<br></p><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Bread 10 -&gt; 20</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Steak 3 -&gt; 5</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Case 3 -&gt; 5</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Light ammo 5 -&gt; 30</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Concrete 0 -&gt; 50</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Steel 0 -&gt; 40</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Balancing of Country Production bonus.</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">I added a new \"Specialization\" law that allow every country to chose 1 item to specialize in (10 days cooldown).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">I wanted a big change that gonna allow even small countries to get some companies on their territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The production bonus will apply ONLY on the production of this resource.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Because of theses change and to make it easier for ppl to move company. I added a list of suggested place when moving a company.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Tournament</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Country tournaments now rely on initial country development instead of population. (this parameter is influenced by average level of the pop)</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Christmas country tournament will start today.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Migrations</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The damage you already done will be included in new military rank system.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">All country gonna get a random specialized item.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">All users will be able to claim starting missions bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Users with lvl &lt; 20 will get startup items diff.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Other changes</h3><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Search of players now displays active players first.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Added 12h cooldown for proposing buy region law.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Bounty \\user / mu / country ranking</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">All weapons crit percent do not overlap anymore, for example tank crit chance range is now 21-30% instead of 10-30% (this change don't concern existing weapons).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">New emotes</p></li></ul><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":4Evil:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":4Evil:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":Bedge:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":Bedge:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":CAUGHT:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":CAUGHT:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":coffeePeepo:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":coffeePeepo:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":Floshed:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":Floshed:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":HmmNoted:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":HmmNoted:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":Nono:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":Nono:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":Okay:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":Okay:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":peepoBox:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":peepoBox:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":peepoClown:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":peepoClown:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":ReallyMad:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":ReallyMad:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":SHRUG:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":SHRUG:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":WAHHH:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":WAHHH:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":Waiting:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":Waiting:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":War:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":War:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":YesYes:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":YesYes:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":SNIFFA:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":SNIFFA:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":peepoFeet:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":peepoFeet:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":Cinema:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":Cinema:\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Fira Code&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;\"> </span><span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":peepoBlink:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":peepoBlink:\"></span><br></p><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>Happy Christmas everyone</em> <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"emote\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\":peepoSnow:\" contenttype=\"emote\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\":peepoSnow:\"></span></p>","language":"en","category":"official","author":"6813b758efecdf9bab195068","stats":{"likes":3346,"views":8575,"comments":183,"subs":139,"tips":560,"dislikes":9,"score":3337},"isPublished":true,"isDeleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-12-24T00:25:52.805Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-04T14:51:47.232Z","__v":0,"publishedAt":"2025-12-26T00:27:30.936Z","slug":"v0-21-0-beta-happy-christmas-5b8154"},{"_id":"695e9bb5b167f59ac51fec37","title":"v0.22.0-beta","content":"<hr><h1 style=\"text-align: left;\">Deposits</h1><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Deposits now have a duration between 1 and 5 days. (Instead of a quantity that lasted ~10h)</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">They can be discovered every hour instead of every 12h.</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Workers</h2><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Workers now have a new fidelity bonus, applied 1 time a day after the work is done for the same company.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">This bonus is applied after work. So it is not counted in wage.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Fidelity bonus increase by 1% per day worked, until 10%</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Transferring workers do not reset the fidelity bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Being fired, leave company or changing job does reset this fidelity bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Workers wage can be edited (only increase).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Added notifications for wage changes &amp; company transfers.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Workers no longer get fired when out of authorized wage range. Wage is now adjusted.</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Management skill</h2><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">We are removing break rooms upgrade of companies. We want to limit amount of the workers a user can have (120 =&gt; 12).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">So we added a new eco skill (management), that will allow you to hire more workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Starts from 2 to 12 workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Everyone got 1 free reset &amp; reset of cooldown.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Every break rooms got deleted and refunded at 100% invested steel.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">When you reach workers limit, you cannot post work offer or produce until you fix it (fire workers or upgrade management skill).</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Work stats (supporters)</h2><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Premium users have access to the work stats of their workers and companies.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Day by day charts of total prod / employees prod / self work / automated engine / wage spent</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Work offers</h2><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Work offers displays wage after taxes (but are still ordered by wage before taxes for technical reasons).</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Work offers now can have a min energy, min production, and a required citizenship.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Work offers can be edited.</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Other changes</h2><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Rework of line charts</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Volume traded &amp; transactions counts in item trading charts.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Displaying job market infos in companies page, work offer form &amp; workers edit form.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Added a color code for taxes (0% : gray | &lt;= 10% : green | &lt;=20% : orange | &gt; 20% : red)</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Added wage tax information in move company modal.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Added a notification \"Round about to end\" when a team get terrain &gt;= 290.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Removed Christmas assets.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">New sounds by <span data-content-link=\"\" data-content-type=\"user\" data-content-data=\"{}\" data-original-text=\"https://app.warera.io/user/688b562b063503101c074de2\" contenttype=\"user\" data=\"[object Object]\" originaltext=\"https://app.warera.io/user/688b562b063503101c074de2\"></span></p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ability to select events types in the event feed.</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Other changes I forgot...</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">Already implemented but not mentioned</h2><ul class=\"tight\" data-tight=\"true\"><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ability to fight even after hp &lt; 10 (depending on armor stat)</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Fix access of country/mu trading orders done by someone else</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">More translations</p></li><li><p class=\"tiptap-block\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Inactive supporters get an email notification about their active subscription.</p></li></ul>","language":"en","category":"official","author":"6813b758efecdf9bab195068","stats":{"likes":2024,"views":5212,"comments":60,"subs":21,"tips":2,"dislikes":2,"score":2022},"isPublished":true,"isDeleted":false,"createdAt":"2026-01-07T17:45:25.361Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-04T09:13:20.514Z","__v":0,"publishedAt":"2026-01-09T17:45:31.725Z","slug":"v0-22-0-beta-1fec37"}],"nextCursor":"v2.W3sidCI6Im51bSIsInYiOjIwMjJ9LHsidCI6InN0ciIsInYiOiI2OTVlOWJiNWIxNjdmNTlhYzUxZmVjMzcifV0"}}}